**Agent Guardrails**

| Guardrail Type    | Purpose               | How it’s Handled               |
| ----------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Scope Enforcement | Blocks off-topic      | Fallback: “Not configured”     |
| Response Limits   | Prevents fake answers | Use only PDFs & Knowledge      |
| Intent Check      | Confirms user input   | Ask for missing info           |
| Role Control      | Shows proper actions  | Based on profile               |
| Data Sensitivity  | Avoids PII exposure   | Mask or skip sensitive data    |
| Escalation Logic  | Sends to live agent   | Flow-based fallback            |
| Missing Input     | Handles gaps          | Prompt user to re-enter        |
| Standard Output   | Keeps tone clear      | Same structure for all replies |

