**Results Summary**

* Job 1 saw most traffic; many cases were resolved using articles.
* Job 3 helped users quickly check invoice status.
* Job 2 got good clicks when webinar matched the product used.
* Job 4 helped internal users act faster.

**Challenges & Lessons**

* Some delays due to backend data sync.
* Users gave vague questions, required follow-ups.
* Guardrails helped prevent errors.
* For rollout, test each job early and get legal involved.

